quiz.prompt:
The VERI (data), SAAT (clock) and MANDAL (latch) pins are correctly connected to the 74HC595 (QA is the first LED, QH the eighth). Which LEDs light up when these commands run?

```
digitalWrite(MANDAL, LOW);
shiftOut(VERI, SAAT, MSBFIRST, 0b00000101);
digitalWrite(MANDAL, HIGH);
```

The circuit is built correctly, but the display never changes. What is the problem?

```
void yaz(byte desen) {
  digitalWrite(MANDAL, LOW);
  shiftOut(VERI, SAAT, MSBFIRST, desen);
}
```
